      "status": "pass",
      "analysis": "The actual finite-limit comparison is induced by limit projections on records. Finitely many representatives and equality witnesses are moved to one common stage; this proves both injectivity and surjectivity for actual compatible families, including empty diagrams. CategoryLimits and TowerFiniteLimits construct actual categorical limit cones and transfer the canonical comparison, so the result is standard finite-limit preservation. Every group-valued natural transformation is transported to a tensor transformation, whose value on the universe-lifted integer unit determines every pure tensor by naturality at 1-to-a; linearity extends this to the whole tensor product. Identity, composition and natural-isomorphism classification have the required M-to-M-prime direction.",
